      "text": "Coast Guard transformation begins today. At today’s Commencement at the U.S. Coast Guard Academy, Department of Homeland Security Secretary Kristi Noem announced a blueprint to transform the Service, Force Design 2028. Additionally, Secretary Noem announced President Trump’s nomination of Admiral Kevin Lunday as the 28th Commandant of the Coast Guard.    In her remarks to the Coast Guard Academy Class of 2025, Secretary Noem explained how this plan, under Admiral Lunday’s leadership, will revolutionize the Service’s ability to protect and serve the American people.    Learn more about the big changes coming: \n\nMy CG:  https://t.co/gkevRCCwsO)\n Press Release: https://t.co/a2GkFcgVcc\n\nWeb Link: https://t.co/P3Ta6uYCoV  \n@DHSgov @Sec_Noem \n\n#USCG #CoastGuard #ForceDesign2028",
      "text_resolved": "Coast Guard transformation begins today. At today’s Commencement at the U.S. Coast Guard Academy, Department of Homeland Security Secretary Kristi Noem announced a blueprint to transform the Service, Force Design 2028. Additionally, Secretary Noem announced President Trump’s nomination of Admiral Kevin Lunday as the 28th Commandant of the Coast Guard.    In her remarks to the Coast Guard Academy Class of 2025, Secretary Noem explained how this plan, under Admiral Lunday’s leadership, will revolutionize the Service’s ability to protect and serve the American people.    Learn more about the big changes coming: \n\nMy CG:  https://www.mycg.uscg.mil/News/Article/4194215/sec-noem-announces-force-design-2028-nominee-for-the-next-commandant-during-coa/)\n Press Release: https://www.news.uscg.mil/Press-Releases/Article/4193950/secretary-noem-delivers-coast-guard-academy-commencement-address-announces-new/\n\nWeb Link: https://www.uscg.mil/leadership/commandants-initiatives/forcedesign2028/  \n@DHSgov @Sec_Noem \n\n#USCG #CoastGuard #ForceDesign2028",
