      "text": "The crew of U.S. Coast Guard Cutter Hamilton is training alongside the U.S. Navy and U.S. Marine Corps in the Atlantic during the Amphibious Ready Group and 22nd Marine Expeditionary Unit exercise (ARGMEUEX) — a joint exercise that prepares integrated naval task forces for rapid response to evolving threats.\n\nIntegrated naval training provides combatant commanders and the Commander-in-Chief highly capable forces that deter adversaries to ensure American security and economic prosperity.\n@USCGLANTAREA @DeptofDefense @DHSgov @USNavy @USMC \n#uscg #jointforce #ARGMEUEX #maritimsecurity",
